   "A": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT in relation to requiring the commissioner of taxation and finance to\nstudy the frequency of residents who are being assessed library taxes for more\nthan one library and to make recommendations to prevent the double taxation of\nresidents; and providing for the repeal of such provisions upon expiration\nthereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S7857",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S7857-2021",
    "coSponsors": {
